      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "לבנות…לבנות",
      "rationale": "Kuma kelen-segese 'ka so dila' bɛ taamɛ kumasen in kɔnɔ fila, a ɲɔgɔn-bɔ bɛnu"
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Masakɛ Dawid y'a yɛrɛ sinsin a senw kan, a ko: Nin i mɛn, an balimaw ni ne ka mɔgɔw: ne, ne dusukun de bɛ fɛ ka so dila — sɔɔrɔyɔrɔso — Yawe ka layidu santigi kama, ani an Ala Yawe ka sendabiri ye; ne y'a labɛn ka so dila.",
